| Model | Comparison | Tasks | Pass rate | Difference, points [95% CI] | p | Tasks gained / lost | Verdict |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| `codellama:7b-instruct` | Lookup vs version only | 40 | 42.5% -> 40.0% | -2.5 [-20.0, +15.0] | 1.000 | +5 / -6 | no effect detected |
| `codellama:7b-instruct` | Repair with docs vs repair with log only | 40 | 42.5% -> 65.0% | +22.5 [+10.0, +35.0] | 0.005 | +9 / -0 | useful |
